sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Buyer
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant S as Seller

    title Real-time Dispatch Sequence Diagram

    B->>API: POST /jobs/dispatch {category, location}
    API->>Redis: GEORADIUS available_providers
    Redis-->>API: Nearby provider IDs
    API->>DB: SELECT services WHERE id IN (...)
    DB-->>API: Service details with trust scores
    API->>API: Filter & rank by proximity/trust
    API->>S: WebSocket: Job Offer (60s expiry)
    S->>API: POST /accept_offer (first to respond)
    API->>DB: INSERT Job (pending_payment)
    API->>B: WebSocket: Provider Accepted
    API->>S: WebSocket: Awaiting Payment
    B->>API: Initiate Payment
    API->>API: Process Escrow Hold
    API->>S: WebSocket: Payment Confirmed